MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Jun_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Jun_m01_001: I have heard tell of your remarkable exploits.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Jun_m01_002: But I must warn you, I am not a great one for\nconversation.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Mar_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Mar_m01_001: Hmph. You seek my audience?
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Mar_m01_002: And with such confident eyes... There aren't many\nwho face the Bringer of War with that expression.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Smi_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Smi_m01_001: I'm known as the Spell-Scholar. Well, at least\naround here.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Smi_m01_002: From what I hear, your renown within Dagsion\nhas seen explosive growth.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Car_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Car_m01_001: I am Kalla, a god in the Dagdan pantheon, known as\nthe Patron-Huntress.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Car_m01_002: Please, no need to stand on ceremony. Speak freely\nwith me.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Jun_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Jun_m02_001: You have returned. Please, be at ease. There is no\nneed for such stiffness.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Jun_m02_002: I am well aware that my attendants often fuss over\nmy tendency to tire easily.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Jun_m02_003: Yet my time with you has been so natural that I feel\nnone of the usual strain.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Mar_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Mar_m02_001: Ah, so it's you. Again.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Mar_m02_002: You're a bold one, asking for repeated audiences\nwith me.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Smi_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Smi_m02_001: Why, hello. It's you! What brings you here today?
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Smi_m02_002: For my sake, put matters of deference aside. Now,\nlet's just get to it. I have a little time to spare.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Car_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Car_m02_001: Ah! I wondered who it might be. Here I see—\nit was you!
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Car_m02_002: I hear often of your contributions to my temple.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Jun_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Jun_m03_001: Ah, you've returned. Please be at ease in\nmy presence.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Jun_m03_002: Now, what shall we speak of today?
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Mar_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Mar_m03_001: You again, is it? I welcome it. We're hardly strangers\nat this point.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Mar_m03_002: But don't expect me to engage with you in witty\nrepartee.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Smi_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Smi_m03_001: Oh, here again, I see. Well, that's good. I always\nwelcome your visits.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Smi_m03_002: I find our conversations interesting. Now, what\nshould we talk about today?
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Car_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Car_m03_001: You've made quite a name for yourself in the\nDagdan Empire.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Car_m03_002: Indeed, I often hear you being discussed among\npriests in this very temple.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Jun_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Jun_m04_001: Come to visit again, have you?
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Jun_m04_002: I have felt more animated and...present ever since\nwe started these chats.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Mar_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Mar_m04_001: Back again, hm? Fine. Let's have it.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Mar_m04_002: Most tremble at the sight of me, but you seem to\nbe different.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Smi_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Smi_m04_001: Welcome. I was thinking you'd probably turn up\nagain soon enough.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Smi_m04_002: Believe it or not, I've gone to some effort to carve\nout a good amount of time for you.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Car_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Car_m04_001: Good of you to come. Welcome.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Car_m04_002: Please, regale me with your latest exploits.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Jun_m05: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Jun_m05_001: Your timing is impeccable. I was just wondering\nwhen we would speak again.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Jun_m05_002: I had questions about the city that I hoped you would\nanswer for me.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Mar_m05: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Mar_m05_001: Oh, it's you? Good.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Mar_m05_002: I was just thinking I'd like to speak with you.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Smi_m05: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Smi_m05_001: Ah, it's you, is it? You came at just the right time.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Smi_m05_002: I thought up a new magical theory earlier and just\nfinished writing it all down.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Car_m05: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Car_m05_001: My wish is to elevate the arts and culture of this\nland to new heights.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Car_m05_002: The Rose Pageant, held at my main temple, is one\npart of that project.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Jun_m06: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Jun_m06_001: Ah, you've returned. I lately find myself looking\nforward to your visits.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Jun_m06_002: Even my attendants have noted how I seem more\nvibrant in recent days.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Mar_m06: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Mar_m06_001: I had a feeling you'd stop by. Kept me waiting,\nthough.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Mar_m06_002: Tell me—what has been happening in your\nadventures lately?
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Smi_m06: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Smi_m06_001: Hi there—and welcome! You've come to see\nme again.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Smi_m06_002: I enjoy getting to see you now and then.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Car_m06: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Car_m06_001: Ahaha. I cannot help but look forward to your visits.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Car_m06_002: Have you been well, of late?
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk1_Car_m06_Footer: <TEDF>
MID_LGV_Audience_Topic1_GroupA_m01_001: You heard some interesting stories about the founding of the\nDagdan Empire.
MID_LGV_Audience_Topic1_GroupA_m01_002: You were asked about the Heroic Games and gave your opinion as\na participant.
MID_LGV_Audience_Topic1_GroupA_m01_003: You were taught some unusual tales with practical application in\neveryday life.
MID_LGV_Audience_Topic1_GroupA_m01_004: You were asked your impression of Dagsion and gave your\nhonest opinion.
MID_LGV_Audience_Topic1_GroupA_m01_005: You heard the god's thoughts concerning faith across the\nDagdan Empire.
MID_LGV_Audience_Topic1_GroupB_m01_001: You had an enjoyable chat about trivialities such as questions that\narise in your everyday life.
MID_LGV_Audience_Topic1_GroupB_m01_002: You had a lively discussion about the laws of the Dagdan Empire.
MID_LGV_Audience_Topic1_GroupB_m01_003: You exchanged opinions about the calendar used within the\nDagdan Empire.
MID_LGV_Audience_Topic1_GroupB_m01_004: You talked about your favorite dishes and ingredients, leading to\na heated debate.
MID_LGV_Audience_Topic1_GroupB_m01_005: You were asked about your favorite opera performances, resulting in\na spirited discussion.
MID_LGV_Audience_Topic1_GroupC_m01_001: You had a very lively discussion about the most comfortable shape\nof pillow to sleep on.
MID_LGV_Audience_Topic1_GroupC_m01_002: You were asked about how one should treat one's subordinates,\nand made suggestions using past experience as examples.
MID_LGV_Audience_Topic1_GroupC_m01_003: You inquired about advice for relationships with one's family,\nand listened attentively to what they had to say.
MID_LGV_Audience_Topic1_GroupC_m01_004: You were asked about hobbies you've been absorbed in recently,\nand as a result lost track of the time.
MID_LGV_Audience_Topic1_GroupC_m01_005: The conversation turned to popular hairstyles, leading you to discover\nan unexpected side of the god.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Jun_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Jun_m01_001: Gracious, how time flies. I was wrapped up in\nour conversation.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Jun_m01_002: How long has it been since I spoke so freely\nwith anyone?
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Jun_m01_003: But I must attend to my next appointment, and so\nyou should take your leave.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Mar_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Mar_m01_001: My grandson Gladius was once the king of\nBrezarant.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Mar_m01_002: But he's retired long since. Though old, he still\npossesses great strength.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Mar_m01_003: Should your paths ever cross, do learn what you can\nfrom him.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Smi_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Smi_m01_001: Honestly, I don't like making time for audiences\nwith visitors like this.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Smi_m01_002: I find it far more meaningful to immerse myself\nin the research of magic.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Smi_m01_003: Ah, but never mind that. This is part of my job,\nafter all.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Car_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Car_m01_001: As I see it, art is the purest expression of the feelings\nin our hearts.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Car_m01_002: It enriches the people, the culture...and in that sense,\nstrengthens the empire.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Car_m01_003: Please, come again, if you have the chance. I would\nlike to speak to you about all manner of things.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Jun_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Jun_m02_001: In eastern Lambath, the site of my main temple,\nthere are many lakes that yield a good deal of salt.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Jun_m02_002: Roughly half of the salt in circulation in this land\nwas collected there.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Jun_m02_003: Even places inhospitable to life may contain\nbounties that can enrich us all.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Mar_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Mar_m02_001: Battles aren't won merely with training and ability.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Mar_m02_002: They're won by the will of the heavens.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Mar_m02_003: Some people are surprised to hear me say that.\nAfter all, it sounds like I'm chalking it all up to luck.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Mar_m02_004: But when you've seen as much battle as I have,\nyou'll experience events that prove I'm right.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Smi_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Smi_m02_001: A percentage of what some call spirit magic in\nthis land is actually magic I created long ago.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Smi_m02_002: I like magic research more than anything, as it brings\nme closer to underlying truths about this world.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Smi_m02_003: Though I have to admit...my own family has no\nidea what I mean when I speak of that.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Car_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Car_m02_001: I find you such an intriguing person to converse with.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Car_m02_002: You know, to my mind, a person's true nature is\nrevealed when they dance.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Car_m02_003: I hope you will dance to the music of my vihuela\none day.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Jun_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Jun_m03_001: There are many different kinds of creatures found\nin the land of Dagda.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Jun_m03_002: But I find the beauty of the monoceros particularly\nastonishing.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Jun_m03_003: They are cautious and proud creatures. It is difficult\nto tame one, but they are stronger than most horses.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Jun_m03_004: One who could win such an animal's loyalty would\nfind themselves with a powerful companion.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Mar_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Mar_m03_001: Long ago, around 350 years in the past, some giants\nappeared in western Brezarant.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Mar_m03_002: So Gladius and I departed to get rid of them.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Mar_m03_003: Now referred to as "Mars's Giant Hunt," that day is\na topic of the bards' songs.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Smi_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Smi_m03_001: Most of the humans who come here have ulterior\nmotives. It's...very obvious.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Smi_m03_002: I find those discussions so extremely tedious.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Car_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Car_m03_001: While I care little for fighting, I think I may watch\nyour next match.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Car_m03_002: Out of concern for you, I would be willing to watch\na match if it were one of yours.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Jun_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Jun_m04_001: It is a common misunderstanding that "Arc" refers\nto the weapon itself.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Jun_m04_002: In truth, some magics are known as Arcs despite\nthe lack of a physical form.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Jun_m04_003: Originally, "Arcs" meant words of power. The true\nform of an Arc is the spell inscribed on the weapon.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Jun_m04_004: It is these words that bestow power on the wielder.\nA blessing directly from the progenitor god.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Mar_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Mar_m04_001: There aren't many who know this anymore, but I can\ntake on the form of a dragon.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Mar_m04_002: When I do, I can wield far more power than when\nI'm in my current form.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Mar_m04_003: Not all gods can become dragons...but I couldn't tell\nyou why not.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Smi_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Smi_m04_001: It's a surprise to some, given my standing around\nhere, that I'm extremely fond of cats.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Smi_m04_002: I find it endlessly wonderful to bury my face in\ntheir furry little bellies.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Smi_m04_003: I also collect cat statues and paintings. I'd love to\nshow them to you someday.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Car_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Car_m04_001: I struggle to comprehend those who think of nothing\nbut fighting.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Car_m04_002: When you are so single-minded, don't you miss out\non the richness of life?
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Car_m04_003: Ah, apologies. It's not you I'm speaking of. It's my\nbrother Mars.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Car_m04_004: I hope this hasn't come across as whiny. Please,\nforget I said that.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Jun_m05: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Jun_m05_001: Among the Dagdan pantheon, I am second in rank\nbehind Divine Emperor Dagda.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Jun_m05_002: Many years ago, when he entered his long slumber...
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Jun_m05_003: I was often asked why I did not take up the mantle\nof Divine Sovereign.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Jun_m05_004: The weight of such a responsibility was too much for\nme at the time. So I passed the crown to Solel.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Mar_m05: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Mar_m05_001: You know, I've been hearing much about your\nfeats lately.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Mar_m05_002: Hehe. Good. Somehow, hearing you're gaining a\nreputation puts me in a better mood.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Mar_m05_003: Some part of me doesn't think of you as a stranger.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Smi_m05: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Smi_m05_001: My family is full of wild eccentrics, you know. Not\nthat I can throw stones.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Smi_m05_002: Mars thinks of nothing but fighting all year round.\nFortuna rarely makes an appearance at all.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Smi_m05_003: My brother Solel is straitlaced to a fault. Any\ntalk with him exhausts me.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Smi_m05_004: Credna is the only one I see eye to eye with, though\nI haven't actually seen him for a long time.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Car_m05: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Car_m05_001: I give the title Rose of Caelus as a sort of means to\nattract people of excellence.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Car_m05_002: By bestowing the appellation in recognition of their\nabilities, I am giving my seal of approval.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Car_m05_003: And they garner attention, causing new art to bloom\nthroughout the land.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Jun_m06: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Jun_m06_001: There can be no doubt that spending time with you\nhas brought my heart some peace.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Jun_m06_002: It would do me good if you continued to visit me.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Mar_m06: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Mar_m06_001: Ha. I actually like these little chats.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Mar_m06_002: Drop on by whenever you like. I'll make time.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Smi_m06: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Smi_m06_001: I'm widely considered to be a misanthrope. But I\nnever dislike speaking with you.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Smi_m06_002: It seems that I've grown very fond of you, actually.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Smi_m06_003: Please come visit me here any time. I will always\nwelcome you.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Car_m06: <TH>
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Car_m06_001: I'm so glad when you come visit me.
MID_LGV_Audience_Talk2_Car_m06_002: Come whenever you like. You'll be welcomed here.